<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on SMI index.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on SMI index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG</p>
<p>said it has issued 75,000 European-style warrants, on the SMI</p>
<p>index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3900 CHF		  ISSUE PRICE  33 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	05.MAR.97		 PAYDATE	16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			SPOT REF     3895 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES     THE WARRANTS ARE TERMED &quot;SPRING UP AND OUT WARRANTS</p>
<p>WITH REBATE' THERE IS A KNOCK OUT LEVEL OF 4100. IF THE WARRANT HAS NOT BEEN KNOCKED OUT (ON A CONTINUOUS BASIS) THE HOLDER WILL RECEIVE THE CASH DIFFERENCE OF THE INDEX CLOSE MINUS THE STRIKE PRICE. IF THE WARRANT HAS BEEN KNOCKED OUT THE HOLDER WILL RECEIVE THE REBATE OF 45.0 CHF.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
